## Hand-written package header.
##
## `make ipk` (tools/ipkbuild) reads Maintainer and License from this file and
## computes every other field (Package, Version, Architecture, Depends,
## Installed-Size, Description) from what it actually packs. Keeping the two
## identity fields here means a release cannot ship with a placeholder
## maintainer, and the package metadata cannot drift from the file layout.
Maintainer: luqman-v1 <https://github.com/luqman-v1/9router-go/issues>
License: MIT
